<title>MEXICO: Mexico Pajaritos crude port still shut by weather.</title>
<headline>Mexico Pajaritos crude port still shut by weather.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's crude oil export port of Pajaritos was still closed early Monday due to bad weather, a port official said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is still closed here. We will check again at 10 a.m. (1600 GMT),&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The port has been closed since 3:15 p.m. Saturday (2115 GMT), he added.</p>
<p>Officials at the two other key crude ports of Dos Bocas and Cayo Arcas could not be reached for an update on the weather situation there.</p>
<p>Late Sunday, Dos Bocas was closed but Cayo Arcas was open, according to the Communications and Transport Ministry.</p>
<p>((--Martin Langfield, Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9558))</p>
